      "description": "Shared ink pill; inherits home ink inside the presentation.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-primary\">Explore the work <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></button>",
